# Airbnb-pipeline (local Docker)

## What this does
- Spins up Postgres (container)
- Runs init scripts (01_schemas.sql -> 02_tables.sql -> 03_indexes.sql)
- Starts the pipeline app after Postgres is healthy
- Pipeline loads CSVs into raw schema, runs curated + optimised transforms

## How to run
1. Copy your CSVs into `./data/` (or ensure they are available on host at `/mnt/data`)
   - `RAW_HOST.csv`
   - `RAW_LISTING.csv`
   - `RAW_REVIEWS.csv`

2. Start:
```bash
docker compose up --build



