## Quick checklist & tips
- Copy your **actual CSVs** into the repository `./data/` folder (or keep them at `/mnt/data` — the app checks both paths).
  - Your uploaded files were at `/mnt/data/RAW_REVIEWS.csv`, `/mnt/data/RAW_LISTING.csv`, `/mnt/data/RAW_HOST.csv` — the pipeline will find them if left there.
- If you see `PostgreSQL Database directory appears to contain a database; Skipping initialization`, you must remove the volume to force the init files to be executed:
  ```bash
  docker compose down -v
  docker volume ls
  docker volume rm <your_volume_name>
  docker compose up --build
